WEBVTT

00:02.377 --> 00:03.878
Captioning Provided By:
Mtv networks
字幕提供者：
音乐电视网

00:03.962 --> 00:05.296
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:05.380 --> 00:06.506
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:06.589 --> 00:08.425
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：
是的，是的，船长。

00:08.508 --> 00:10.844
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:10.927 --> 00:13.638
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.722 --> 00:15.890
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:15.974 --> 00:17.726
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.809 --> 00:20.103
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:20.186 --> 00:21.896
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.980 --> 00:24.190
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:24.274 --> 00:26.192
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:26.276 --> 00:27.652
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:27.736 --> 00:29.404
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:29.487 --> 00:31.072
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:31.156 --> 00:32.532
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:32.615 --> 00:34.576
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:34.659 --> 00:37.120
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

01:14.491 --> 01:18.787
Squidward, my man,
you are perfect.
章鱼哥，我的男人，
你很完美。

01:23.333 --> 01:24.709
Oh, no.
哦，不。

01:24.793 --> 01:26.753
My kelp garden is all wilted.
我的海带花园都枯萎了。

01:26.836 --> 01:28.755
Don't worry, fellows.
别担心，伙计们。

01:28.838 --> 01:30.215
I've got just the thing
to perk you up.
我只有这样的东西
让你振作起来。

01:30.298 --> 01:31.549
"Kelp Grow."
“海带生长。”

01:31.633 --> 01:33.468
Hold still.
保持不动。

01:40.475 --> 01:43.603
They're... pretty...
他们……漂亮……

01:45.396 --> 01:46.731
Patrick?
帕特里克？

01:46.815 --> 01:48.358
And  SpongeBob.
还有海绵宝宝。

01:48.441 --> 01:50.276
What are you two doing here?
你们两个在这里做什么？

01:50.360 --> 01:52.195
Patrick is helping me
to do good deeds today.
帕特里克正在帮助我
今天要做善事。

01:52.278 --> 01:53.696
Like trimming your kelp garden.
就像修剪你的海带花园一样。

01:59.077 --> 02:01.454
Stop eating my kelp!
别再吃我的海带了！

02:01.538 --> 02:03.706
Ok, ok, geez.
好吧，好吧，哎呀。

02:03.790 --> 02:05.917
Try to help a fellow out.
尝试帮助一个人。

02:06.000 --> 02:08.628
I'll just have to eat
this ice cream cone instead.
我只需要吃饭
这个蛋卷冰淇淋代替。

02:08.711 --> 02:12.799
Oh, do you like to
eat ice cream, Patrick?
哦，你喜欢吗
吃冰淇淋吗，帕特里克？

02:12.882 --> 02:14.008
Hmm...
唔...

02:14.092 --> 02:15.301
Yeah.
是的。

02:15.385 --> 02:18.972
Then have some more.
然后再吃一些。

02:19.055 --> 02:20.974
Whoa.
哇哦。

02:22.433 --> 02:24.227
Still want that ice cream?
还想要那个冰淇淋吗？

02:24.310 --> 02:26.229
Why, I do.
为什么，我愿意。

02:26.312 --> 02:27.605
Thanks, Squidward.
谢谢，章鱼哥。

02:27.689 --> 02:29.482
Want some, SpongeBob?
想要一些吗，海绵宝宝？

02:29.566 --> 02:31.276
Last one to the cone
is a rotten clam.
最后一个到达锥体
是一个烂蛤蜊。

02:33.111 --> 02:35.113
Are you done yet?
你完成了吗？

02:38.241 --> 02:40.159
All done.
全部完成。

02:40.243 --> 02:43.830
Wow, I wish I had a bottle of
that "Kelp Grow" stuff.
哇，我希望我有一瓶
“海带生长”的东西。

02:43.913 --> 02:45.373
Here you go, SpongeBob.
给你，海绵宝宝。

02:45.456 --> 02:47.167
Thank you, Patrick.
谢谢你，帕特里克。

02:47.250 --> 02:49.085
You know, my shoes
feel kind of tight.
你知道，我的鞋子
感觉有点紧。

02:50.879 --> 02:53.089
Nice and roomy.
漂亮又宽敞。

02:53.173 --> 02:55.300
Do you want
your grow-juice back?
你想要吗
你的生长汁回来了吗？

02:55.383 --> 02:58.052
Oh, no, I only paid for it.
哦，不，我只是付了钱。

02:58.136 --> 03:00.096
I wouldn't want to
deprive you of it.
我不想
剥夺你的权利。

03:00.179 --> 03:01.806
Ok.
好的。

03:01.890 --> 03:03.933
But you said you didn't want it.
但你说过你不想要它。

03:04.017 --> 03:06.686
Fine, why don't you two use it
for your... good deeds?
好吧，你们两个为什么不使用它呢？
为了你的……善行？

03:06.769 --> 03:08.521
That's a great idea, Squidward.
这是个好主意，章鱼哥。

03:08.605 --> 03:09.981
Yeah, I'll go first.
是的，我先走了。

03:13.318 --> 03:14.694
What did you do?
你做了什么？

03:14.777 --> 03:17.030
Ooh...
哦...

03:17.113 --> 03:19.282
Quite an improvement,
don't you think?
相当大的进步，
你不觉得吗？

03:19.365 --> 03:21.284
Oh, yes, I agree completely.
哦，是的，我完全同意。

03:21.367 --> 03:24.746
Come on, Patrick,
let's do some good deed-ing.
来吧，帕特里克，
让我们做一些善事吧。

03:24.829 --> 03:26.039
Yay.
耶。

03:26.122 --> 03:28.374
Hey, get back here.
嘿，回到这里吧。

03:28.458 --> 03:30.460
And fix my nose.
并修复我的鼻子。

03:30.793 --> 03:34.005
Hey, Gary, that shell of yours
looks a little cramped.
嘿，加里，你的那个外壳
看起来有点局促。

03:34.088 --> 03:35.131
Meow.
喵。

03:37.967 --> 03:41.346
There, now you've got
plenty of space.
在那里，现在你已经有了
有足够的空间。

03:41.429 --> 03:43.681
Meow.
喵。

03:43.765 --> 03:46.851
Ah-ha, they went this way.
啊哈，他们朝这边走了。

03:46.935 --> 03:48.603
Meow-meow, meow-meow-meow.
喵喵，喵喵喵。

03:48.686 --> 03:50.146
Meow-meow, meow.
喵喵，喵。

03:50.229 --> 03:51.481
Oh, tell me about it.
哦，告诉我吧。

03:52.815 --> 03:56.319
Meow.
喵。

03:58.988 --> 04:00.073
There he is.
他就在那里。

04:00.156 --> 04:01.324
Get ready.
准备。

04:02.659 --> 04:04.160
Now, Patrick.
现在，帕特里克。

04:08.498 --> 04:09.958
Huh?
啊？

04:12.585 --> 04:14.587
There you go, Mr. Krabs.
好了，蟹老板。

04:14.671 --> 04:16.673
You always wanted to
make "big" money.
你一直想
赚“大”钱。

04:19.425 --> 04:21.344
Good deed accomplished.
好事已成。

04:21.427 --> 04:23.137
I ask for no reward.
我不求任何回报。

04:23.221 --> 04:25.098
You're a saint,
SpongeBob,  a saint.
你是一位圣人，
海绵宝宝，圣人。

04:25.181 --> 04:26.599
I know.
我知道。

04:26.683 --> 04:28.601
And it is a burden I must carry.
这是我必须背负的重担。

04:28.685 --> 04:30.603
But time's a-wasting,
we need another good deed.
但时间却很浪费
我们需要另一件好事。

04:30.687 --> 04:31.938
Oh, I've got one.
哦，我有一个。

04:32.021 --> 04:34.274
Um, you know that thing?
嗯，你知道那件事吗？

04:34.357 --> 04:37.568
Um, right, that thing
that we did that day.
嗯，对了，那个东西
我们那天所做的。

04:37.652 --> 04:39.904
No, the other one, um.
不，另一个，嗯。

04:39.988 --> 04:41.364
Oh, um...
哦，嗯...

04:41.447 --> 04:42.657
Uh, thing...
呃，事情...

04:42.740 --> 04:45.535
SpongeBob...
海绵宝宝...

04:45.618 --> 04:46.953
Hey!
嘿！

04:47.036 --> 04:49.122
Look at what you did to me.
看看你对我做了什么。

04:49.205 --> 04:51.374
You better fix my nose,
or you'll hear from my lawyer.
你最好把我的鼻子修一下
或者你会收到我律师的来信。

04:51.457 --> 04:52.792
Are you sure?
你确定吗？

04:52.875 --> 04:55.378
Yeah, you'll be ugly again.
是的，你又会变得丑陋。

04:55.461 --> 04:57.463
Yes, I'm sure.
是的，我确定。

04:57.547 --> 04:59.966
Hmm, how to fix his nose.
嗯，如何修复他的鼻子。

05:00.049 --> 05:01.884
Well, if you turn
the bottle upside-down
好吧，如果你转身
瓶子倒过来

05:01.968 --> 05:03.803
maybe it will shrink it.
也许它会缩小它。

05:03.886 --> 05:05.388
Patrick, that's brilliant!
帕特里克，太棒了！

05:05.471 --> 05:08.141
No, wait, don't.
不，等等，不要。

05:09.475 --> 05:10.768
Didn't work.
没用。

05:10.852 --> 05:12.729
Well, try it again.
好吧，再试一次。

05:12.812 --> 05:14.313
Hmm, I think I'll just
even him out.
嗯，我想我会
连他也出来了。

05:14.397 --> 05:15.648
First, a bigger head.
首先，头要大。

05:17.400 --> 05:19.277
Now his body is too small.
现在他的身体还太小了。

05:19.360 --> 05:21.279
Right, too small.
对了，太小了。

05:21.362 --> 05:23.322
Arms are too short.
胳膊太短了。

05:23.406 --> 05:24.782
Legs are too short.
腿太短了。

05:25.700 --> 05:26.951
Other arm.
另一只手臂。

05:27.869 --> 05:29.328
Feet too small.
脚太小了。

05:30.246 --> 05:31.372
Teeth.
牙齿。

05:32.582 --> 05:34.417
Belly button.
肚脐。

05:34.500 --> 05:37.170
Mwah, perfect.
哇，完美。

05:37.253 --> 05:40.173
I look horrible.
我看起来很可怕。

05:40.256 --> 05:42.091
Ew...
呃……

05:43.926 --> 05:46.220
Ugh, he  inked.
呃，他画了墨。

05:46.304 --> 05:48.389
Well, pardon my anatomy.
好吧，请原谅我的解剖学。

05:48.473 --> 05:49.724
What's happening?
发生什么事了？

05:55.438 --> 05:56.689
All right.
好的。

05:56.773 --> 05:58.524
What did you do to me?
你对我做了什么？

05:58.608 --> 06:00.193
I know, I know, uh...
我知道，我知道，呃……

06:00.276 --> 06:02.195
Made you a monster.
让你变成了怪物。

06:02.278 --> 06:03.529
And a giant.
还有一个巨人。

06:03.613 --> 06:05.364
A giant monster.
一个巨大的怪物。

06:05.448 --> 06:08.493
I don't want to be
a giant, lumbering monster.
我不想成为
一个巨大而笨重的怪物。

06:08.576 --> 06:09.702
What'll I do now?
我现在该怎么办？

06:09.786 --> 06:11.704
That's easy.
这很容易。

06:11.788 --> 06:13.790
Play giant, lumbering
monster tag.
扮演巨人，笨重
怪物标签。

06:13.873 --> 06:15.792
Yeah, yeah, you chase us.
是啊是啊，你追我们。

06:15.875 --> 06:18.211
And we run around
and scream like crazy.
我们到处跑
并疯狂地尖叫。

06:19.796 --> 06:23.091
Try and catch us,
giant monster Squidward.
尝试抓住我们，
巨型怪物章鱼哥。

06:25.927 --> 06:28.721
SpongeBob, come back here.
海绵宝宝，回来吧。

06:32.683 --> 06:33.851
This is really fun.
这真的很有趣。

06:36.104 --> 06:38.856
I know, we should do this,
, more often.
我知道，我们应该这样做，
，更频繁。

06:43.027 --> 06:45.279
Monster!
怪物！

06:53.079 --> 06:54.747
Crowd: Monster!
众人：怪物！

06:54.831 --> 06:57.667
Monster.
怪物。

07:01.337 --> 07:02.380
Huh?
啊？

07:11.013 --> 07:13.182
You are very good at
pretending, Squidward.
你很擅长
假装，章鱼哥。

07:13.266 --> 07:15.852
Look how you're all
sweaty and angry.
看看你们都怎么样
满头大汗又生气。

07:15.935 --> 07:17.520
And you got the whole town
to play along.
然后你就得到了整个城镇
一起玩。

07:17.603 --> 07:19.147
What the?
什么？

07:19.230 --> 07:20.940
Kick him.
踢他。

07:21.023 --> 07:22.942
Let's skin him
and make back-bacon.
我们来剥他的皮
并制作培根。

07:23.025 --> 07:25.528
Scoop out his eyeballs
and use 'em as...
挖出他的眼珠子
并将它们用作...

07:25.611 --> 07:27.613
giant, misshapen soccer balls.
巨大的、畸形的足球。

07:27.697 --> 07:29.991
Yeah, yeah...
是啊是啊...

07:30.074 --> 07:32.577
Wait, maybe he's a nice monster
等等，也许他是个不错的怪物

07:32.660 --> 07:34.996
like in my storybook.
就像我的故事书里那样。

07:36.122 --> 07:38.791
Oh, right, I hadn't
thought of that.
哦，对了，我没有
想到了这一点。

07:38.875 --> 07:40.209
Well, are you?
嗯，你是吗？

07:40.293 --> 07:42.211
Oh, goodness gracious, yes.
哦，天哪，是的。

07:42.295 --> 07:45.464
Squidward is the nicest
giant of them all.
章鱼哥最帅了
他们都是巨人。

07:45.548 --> 07:48.342
Yeah, Squidward, tell 'em
about all those times
是的，章鱼哥，告诉他们
关于所有那些时间

07:48.426 --> 07:50.261
you didn't
punch me in the face.
你没有
打我的脸。

07:50.344 --> 07:51.804
Even though you
really wanted to.
即使你
真的很想。

07:51.888 --> 07:53.806
Oh, quiet, you moron!
噢，安静点，你这个白痴！

07:56.017 --> 07:58.311
He hurt
the little one's feelings.
他受伤了
小孩子的感受。

07:58.394 --> 07:59.979
Why, that's not
very nice at all.
为什么，那不是
非常好。

08:00.062 --> 08:02.231
Take him down, boys.
把他打倒，孩子们。

08:04.859 --> 08:06.944
Ow!
噢！

08:13.201 --> 08:14.911
This ought to fix him, ha-ha.
这样应该可以解决他的问题了，哈哈。

08:17.079 --> 08:19.665
Ok, ok, I'm nice.
好吧好吧，我很好。

08:19.749 --> 08:22.001
Now will you leave me alone?
现在你能留下我一个人吗？

08:22.084 --> 08:24.128
Oh, yeah? Then prove it.
哦，是吗？然后证明一下。

08:24.212 --> 08:27.256
Yeah, are you
nice enough to... um...
是啊，你是吗
足够好...嗯...

08:27.340 --> 08:29.926
Compliment me on my new hairdo?
夸我的新发型吗？

08:30.009 --> 08:32.011
Uh, sure, whatever.
呃，当然，无论如何。

08:32.094 --> 08:34.305
Thank you.
谢谢。

08:34.388 --> 08:37.600
Let the junior guppies
camp out under your toenails?
让小孔雀鱼
在你的脚趾甲下扎营？

08:40.102 --> 08:42.480
Take me to the top of
Mount Humongous?
带我到山顶
巨大山？

08:42.563 --> 08:46.859
Whee...
呼……

08:46.943 --> 08:48.611
Blow on my old windmill.
吹我的旧风车。

08:51.030 --> 08:52.406
Do my homework?
我做作业吗？

08:52.490 --> 08:53.699
Dust my attic?
给我的阁楼除尘？

08:53.783 --> 08:54.825
Feed my snail?
喂我的蜗牛吗？

08:56.953 --> 09:00.039
Wow, this giant really is
friendly, after all.
哇这个巨人真的是
毕竟，友好。

09:00.122 --> 09:02.166
He taught my grandmother
how to read.
他教我祖母
如何阅读。

09:02.250 --> 09:06.128
He helped me start my own
blimp ride company.
他帮助我开始了自己的事业
飞艇乘坐公司。

09:06.212 --> 09:08.172
He helped me build a...
他帮助我建立了一个...

09:08.256 --> 09:11.550
a... a...
一个...一个...

09:12.927 --> 09:14.345
Gesundheit.
完全正确。

09:14.428 --> 09:15.429
Gesundheit.
完全正确。

09:15.513 --> 09:16.639
Crowd: Ahem.
众人：咳咳。

09:16.722 --> 09:17.765
What?
什么？

09:19.225 --> 09:20.476
He didn't say bless you.
他没有说祝福你。

09:20.559 --> 09:21.769
Get him!
抓住他！

09:28.442 --> 09:29.819
Where'd he go?
他去哪儿了？

09:29.902 --> 09:31.737
Is that him over there?
那边是他吗？

09:31.821 --> 09:33.906
Uh... I'm a lamppost.
呃...我是一根灯柱。

09:33.990 --> 09:35.908
Oh.
哦。

09:35.992 --> 09:37.326
Well, let's go check
down by the creek.
嗯，我们去检查一下
就在小溪边。

09:37.410 --> 09:39.495
We'll teach him to dip his feet.
我们会教他浸脚。

09:48.212 --> 09:52.675
Well, Squidward, I guess
this is your new life.
嗯，章鱼哥，我想
这是你的新生活。

09:52.758 --> 09:55.011
And this is your new bed.
这是你的新床。

09:55.094 --> 09:57.555
Good night, old life.
晚安，老生活。

09:59.015 --> 10:00.891
I'll miss you.
我会想念你。

10:00.975 --> 10:02.143
SpongeBob: Good night,
Squidward.
海绵宝宝：晚安，
章鱼哥。

10:02.226 --> 10:04.228
Where are you?
你在哪里？

10:04.312 --> 10:05.730
SpongeBob: Patrick and I
are having a sleepover...
海绵宝宝：帕特里克和我
正在过夜...

10:05.813 --> 10:06.939
in your bellybutton.
在你的肚脐里。

10:08.441 --> 10:10.026
What the- get out of there.
怎么了——离开那里。

10:11.027 --> 10:14.113
You two have ruined my life.
你们两个毁了我的生活。

10:19.118 --> 10:22.246
Oh, Patrick, this is terrible.
哦，帕特里克，这太糟糕了。

10:22.330 --> 10:24.915
Squidward did not like
the kindness we did him.
章鱼哥不喜欢
我们对他的善意。

10:24.999 --> 10:26.250
So?
所以？

10:26.334 --> 10:28.044
We shall do him another.
我们再给他做一次。

10:33.299 --> 10:34.717
SpongeBob: We did it.
海绵宝宝：我们做到了。

10:43.559 --> 10:45.186
What the?
什么？

10:45.269 --> 10:46.854
Since our last kindness
didn't go so well
自从我们上次的善意
进展不太顺利

10:46.937 --> 10:48.647
we brought you a new one.
我们给你带来了一件新的。

10:50.107 --> 10:52.485
A giant clarinet?
巨型单簧管？

10:58.407 --> 11:00.076
And it sounds divine.
这听起来很神圣。

11:00.409 --> 11:01.660
Ah...
啊...

11:06.582 --> 11:10.920
Now I'm too small to play
my giant clarinet.
现在我太小了，不能玩
我的巨型单簧管。

11:16.717 --> 11:19.929
It was the most beautiful thing
I've ever played.
这是最美的事情
我曾经玩过。

11:20.012 --> 11:23.599
Well, at least I still
have my kelp garden.
嗯，至少我还是
有我的海带花园。

11:25.768 --> 11:27.186
What?
什么？

11:27.269 --> 11:29.980
You cut it down?
你把它砍掉了吗？

11:30.064 --> 11:32.900
We used your kelp to make
a kelp-mâché clarinet.
我们用你的海带做了
海带混合单簧管

11:57.299 --> 11:59.427
Oh, I thought
I told that kid not to
哦，我以为
我告诉那孩子不要

11:59.510 --> 12:03.431
put the organic sea cucumber on
top of the free-range anemones.
放上有机海参
自由放养海葵的顶部。

12:05.349 --> 12:07.977
Well, at least my flowers
survived the trip.
好吧，至少我的花
这次旅行幸存下来。

12:17.903 --> 12:20.948
SpongeBob, would you please
find your own flowers to sniff?
海绵宝宝，你愿意吗
找到你自己的花来闻？

12:21.031 --> 12:24.076
What about Patrick, does he have
to find his own flowers too?
帕特里克呢，他有吗？
也去寻找属于自己的花吗？

12:25.494 --> 12:28.205
what are you
talking about, nitwit?
你是什么
在谈论，白痴？

12:28.289 --> 12:30.124
He doesn't even have a nose.
他甚至没有鼻子。

12:30.207 --> 12:32.418
Of course I have
a nose, Squidward.
我当然有
一个鼻子，章鱼哥。

12:32.501 --> 12:35.087
Why, it's at plain as
the nose on my...
为什么，很简单
鼻子在我的...

12:36.797 --> 12:37.923
Face?
脸？

12:38.007 --> 12:40.092
Oh-ho...
哦嚯...

12:47.349 --> 12:48.851
You're right, Squidward.
你是对的，章鱼哥。

12:50.269 --> 12:51.687
My floors.
我的地板。

12:51.770 --> 12:52.855
Think fast, Squiddy.
快想一想，乌贼。

12:52.938 --> 12:54.106
I got your nose.
我抓住了你的鼻子。

12:54.190 --> 12:55.524
You do?
你做？

12:55.608 --> 12:56.775
Yeah, I got it...
是的，我明白了...

12:56.859 --> 12:58.277
right here.
就在这里。

12:58.360 --> 13:00.237
Patrick: Give it, give it here.
帕特里克：给它，给这里。

13:00.321 --> 13:01.655
If you want it,
you gotta go get it.
如果你想要的话，
你得去拿它。

13:05.409 --> 13:07.328
There.
那里。

13:07.411 --> 13:10.331
Well, SpongeBob, what do
you think of my new nose?
那么，海绵宝宝，该怎么办
你想到我的新鼻子了吗？

13:10.414 --> 13:11.957
Patrick,
that's not a nose, that's a...
帕特里克，
那不是鼻子，那是……

13:14.752 --> 13:16.629
Hermit crab.
寄居蟹。

13:18.547 --> 13:20.716
I guess I'll always be
a noseless freak.
我想我会永远是
一个没有鼻子的怪物

13:20.799 --> 13:23.719
Hey, it's not so abnormal
to be noseless.
嘿嘿，这也没什么不正常的吧
变得没有鼻子。

13:23.802 --> 13:25.221
Just look around.
看看周围吧。

13:25.304 --> 13:27.097
Lots of fish don't have noses.
很多鱼没有鼻子。

13:27.181 --> 13:30.226
Yeah, but all my friends
have noses.
是的，但是我所有的朋友
有鼻子。

13:30.309 --> 13:34.230
You, Squidward, Sandy,
even Mr. Krabs.
你，章鱼哥，桑迪，
甚至是蟹老板。

13:36.565 --> 13:39.485
There y'are.
你在那里。

13:39.568 --> 13:42.905
Well, Patrick, if you're
so concerned about
not having a nose
好吧，帕特里克，如果你是
如此关心
没有鼻子

13:42.988 --> 13:45.574
why don't you just get a new one
stitched onto your face?
你为什么不买一件新的呢
缝在你脸上吗？

13:45.658 --> 13:47.368
I can do that?
我能做到吗？

13:47.451 --> 13:49.328
Woman: Dr. Gauze, dial 118...
女：Gauze 医生，拨打 118...

13:49.411 --> 13:50.704
Well, what do you think?
嗯，你觉得怎么样？

13:50.788 --> 13:52.206
Sorry, Doc.
对不起，博士。

13:52.289 --> 13:53.916
I don't really think it's me.
我真的不认为这是我。

13:53.999 --> 13:56.293
That's a-ok, that's cool.
没关系，这很酷。

13:56.377 --> 13:59.088
As lead surgeon here, I take
the hypothetical oath
作为这里的首席外科医生，我认为
假设的誓言

13:59.171 --> 14:01.131
which means I will not stop.
这意味着我不会停止。

14:01.215 --> 14:02.633
I will not  rest.
我不会休息。

14:02.716 --> 14:04.802
I will not cut a single toenail
我不会剪一个脚趾甲

14:04.885 --> 14:07.137
until the customer
is 100 percent satisfied.
直到顾客
是百分百满意的。

14:07.221 --> 14:10.516
So please, browse our
extensive wall of noses.
所以请浏览我们的
宽阔的鼻壁。

14:10.599 --> 14:13.269
And I will patiently await
your final decision.
而我会耐心等待
你的最终决定。

14:13.352 --> 14:16.272
Ok, well, let's see, hmm.
好吧，让我们看看，嗯。

14:16.355 --> 14:17.773
Excellent choice.
绝佳的选择。

14:22.361 --> 14:26.490
All right, Patrick,
let's unveil the new schnoz.
好吧，帕特里克，
让我们揭开新的schnoz的面纱。

14:26.574 --> 14:29.285
Wait, stop, careful, SpongeBob.
等等，停下来，小心点，海绵宝宝。

14:29.368 --> 14:32.496
This fragile stitching
requires tender care.
这种脆弱的缝线
需要温柔的照顾。

14:32.580 --> 14:35.624
Allow me to carefully
remove the bandages.
请允许我仔细地
取下绷带。

14:46.343 --> 14:47.845
There it is, Patrick.
就是这样，帕特里克。

14:47.928 --> 14:50.681
Your brand-new sniffer.
您的全新嗅探器。

14:50.764 --> 14:55.311
Lookin' good, buddy.
看起来不错，伙计。

14:55.394 --> 14:58.063
Well, I've gotta go to work now.
好吧，我现在得去上班了。

14:58.147 --> 14:59.773
Have fun with your new nose...
祝你的新鼻子玩得开心......

14:59.857 --> 15:01.233
I will.
我会。

15:01.317 --> 15:03.736
Now how do I use this thing?
现在我该如何使用这个东西呢？

15:06.071 --> 15:07.323
What is that smell?
那是什么气味？

15:12.036 --> 15:13.871
Pastries?
糕点？

15:13.954 --> 15:17.458
I never knew
they smelled so good.
我从来不知道
它们闻起来很香。

15:20.252 --> 15:22.755
Well, I guess I won't be
eating those.
嗯，我想我不会
吃那些。

15:26.383 --> 15:29.303
Let's see Patrick destroy these.
让我们看看帕特里克摧毁这些。

15:55.871 --> 15:59.375
All these years, I knew
I was missing out on something.
这些年我就知道
我错过了一些东西。

15:59.458 --> 16:01.835
But I never thought
smelling could be this good.
但我从未想过
闻起来也可以这么好。

16:07.216 --> 16:09.843
What was that horrible smell?
那股可怕的气味是什么？

16:09.927 --> 16:12.846
Onion rings?
洋葱圈？

16:14.682 --> 16:17.976
Sick, nobody told me
about bad smells.
生病了，没人告诉我
关于难闻的气味。

16:19.645 --> 16:21.188
Oh, what is it now?
哦，现在怎么样了？

16:34.785 --> 16:37.788
I'm gonna have to rethink
this whole smelling thing.
我得重新考虑一下
这整个臭东西。

16:47.005 --> 16:49.258
I made it.
我做到了。

16:49.341 --> 16:52.803
At least here at home
I can't be attacked by
those wretched odors.
至少在家里
我不能被攻击
那些难闻的气味。

16:54.388 --> 16:56.765
Bad smells are all around me.
我周围都是难闻的气味。

17:07.443 --> 17:10.571
I cannot live in
these conditions.
我不能住在
这些条件。

17:15.617 --> 17:18.287
Narrator: 48 hours later...
旁白：48小时后……

17:23.333 --> 17:26.336
Hiya, Patrick, I- whoa...
嗨，帕特里克，我——哇……

17:26.420 --> 17:29.048
Hey-hey, lookin' good.
嘿嘿嘿，看起来不错啊

17:29.131 --> 17:30.299
Huh?
啊？

17:30.382 --> 17:31.759
Oh, the smells!
哦，气味！

17:31.842 --> 17:33.552
They're everywhere.
他们无处不在。

17:33.635 --> 17:36.722
It's unbearable.
实在难以忍受。

17:36.805 --> 17:39.016
What's wrong with the pinhead?
针头有什么问题吗？

17:39.933 --> 17:41.393
Oh, it's another one.
哦，这是另一件。

17:41.477 --> 17:42.853
No...
不...

17:42.936 --> 17:44.354
I can't take it.
我受不了。

17:44.438 --> 17:46.315
Where do you think you're going?
你认为你要去哪里？

17:46.398 --> 17:48.484
To do what should've
been done long ago.
去做应该做的事
很久以前就已经完成了。

17:58.994 --> 18:01.371
Sweet Neptune.
甜蜜的海王星。

18:01.455 --> 18:03.791
Imported cheese.
进口奶酪。

18:07.628 --> 18:10.339
This is inexcusable.
这是不可原谅的。

18:10.422 --> 18:12.007
Yuck.
恶心。

18:12.090 --> 18:13.425
What are you doing
with my cheese?
你在做什么
和我的奶酪一起？

18:15.344 --> 18:17.346
Patrick: It's rotten
garbage now.
帕特里克：已经烂了
现在垃圾了。

18:18.931 --> 18:20.516
That's better.
这样更好。

18:20.599 --> 18:22.601
That was my cheese.
那是我的奶酪。

18:22.684 --> 18:25.479
It's supposed to smell
like that, Kelp-for-Brains.
应该有味道
就像这样，海带换大脑。

18:25.562 --> 18:27.815
You are sick, Squidward.
你有病吧，章鱼哥。

18:29.358 --> 18:32.110
That smell again.
又是那个味道。

18:32.194 --> 18:35.114
SpongeBob: One... Two...
海绵宝宝：一……二……

18:35.197 --> 18:37.449
Three...   four....
三……四……

18:39.535 --> 18:43.121
Come on, SquarePants,
be a man!
来吧，方裤，
做个男人吧！

18:49.169 --> 18:50.420
Patrick: You?
帕特里克：你？

18:51.964 --> 18:53.674
Patrick, help.
帕特里克，帮忙。

18:53.757 --> 18:56.426
Oh, I'll help you, all right.
哦，我会帮你的，好吧。

18:56.510 --> 18:58.762
Help stop you from
polluting our world
帮助阻止你
污染我们的世界

18:58.846 --> 19:02.099
with your sweaty holes.
和你出汗的洞。

19:02.182 --> 19:04.101
There.
那里。

19:04.184 --> 19:06.144
I can't work at the Krusty Krab
looking like this.
我不能在蟹堡王工作
看起来像这样。

19:06.228 --> 19:07.646
I'm out of uniform.
我没穿制服了

19:07.729 --> 19:09.481
Well, you can't go to
work smelling like that.
嗯，你不能去
工作就有那样的味道。

19:09.565 --> 19:11.859
Should be thanking me,
SpongeBob.
应该感谢我，
海绵宝宝。

19:12.568 --> 19:14.528
Smells like...
闻起来像...

19:14.611 --> 19:17.489
something greasy.
油腻的东西。

19:23.328 --> 19:25.205
Patrick: Nobody moves!
帕特里克：没人动！

19:25.289 --> 19:28.208
I am ridding this place of
its disgusting stench
我正在摆脱这个地方
其令人厌恶的恶臭

19:28.292 --> 19:31.712
with these scented candles.
用这些香薰蜡烛。

19:35.340 --> 19:38.176
My mouth can't take
these conflicting flavors, augh.
我的嘴无法接受
这些相互冲突的味道，呵呵。

19:40.804 --> 19:44.600
This air freshener
should finish the job.
这款空气清新剂
应该完成工作。

19:49.187 --> 19:51.857
What the barnacles
do you think you're doing?
什么是藤壶
你认为你在做什么？

19:51.940 --> 19:53.859
You're chasing away
all me customers.
你正在追赶
都是我的顾客。

19:57.487 --> 19:59.448
Well, good.
嗯，很好。

19:59.531 --> 20:02.201
No one should have to
eat in this  stench.
没有人应该必须
在这恶臭中吃饭。

20:02.284 --> 20:03.619
What?
什么？

20:03.702 --> 20:05.495
Why, I gotta good mind to...
为什么，我得好好想想……

20:05.579 --> 20:07.623
Say no more, you can
thank me later.
不用多说了，可以
稍后谢谢我。

20:07.706 --> 20:10.876
Right now I've got many more
stink-holes to swab clean.
现在我还有很多
臭洞要擦拭干净。

20:10.959 --> 20:12.878
Oh...
哦...

20:12.961 --> 20:15.047
That new honker of his has
turned him into a complete jerk.
他的新喇叭已经
让他变成了一个彻头彻尾的混蛋。

20:17.424 --> 20:18.967
Hiya, Pat.
你好，帕特。

20:22.262 --> 20:25.515
Take a bath, flea-bag.
洗澡，跳蚤袋。

20:25.599 --> 20:29.311
Mr. Krabs: I've asked y'all here
because we all face
a similar problem.
蟹老板：我已经问过你们了
因为我们都面临着
类似的问题。

20:29.394 --> 20:31.313
The problem being
问题是

20:31.396 --> 20:34.691
a sea-star with a nose
that's gotten way out of hand.
有鼻子的海星
这已经失控了。

20:34.775 --> 20:36.360
Yeah.
是的。

20:36.443 --> 20:38.111
Now what I want to know is
现在我想知道的是

20:38.195 --> 20:40.072
are we gonna
do something about it?
我们要吗
对此做点什么？

20:40.155 --> 20:41.782
Yeah, sure are.
是的，当然是。

20:41.865 --> 20:44.076
Let's give him what for.
让我们给他什么。

20:44.159 --> 20:46.536
Let's hogtie him and run him
out of town on a rail.
我们把他绑起来然后跑吧
乘火车出城。

20:46.620 --> 20:48.497
Sandy and Squidward: Yeah...
桑迪和章鱼哥：是啊……

20:49.748 --> 20:52.668
Come on, SpongeBob,
be a man!
来吧，海绵宝宝，
做个男人吧！

20:52.751 --> 20:54.127
Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板？

20:54.211 --> 20:55.921
Not now, boy.
不是现在，孩子。

20:56.004 --> 20:57.589
We're in the middle of
a public lashing.
我们正处于中间
公开鞭打。

20:57.673 --> 20:59.591
That no-good, nose-flaunting...
那个不好看，鼻子张扬的...

20:59.675 --> 21:02.010
It is not Patrick's fault.
这不是帕特里克的错。

21:02.094 --> 21:03.804
Huh?
啊？

21:03.887 --> 21:05.764
It's the new nose
that has betrayed us.
这是新鼻子
那背叛了我们。

21:05.847 --> 21:07.808
My Grandma SquarePants
always says
我的奶奶方裤
总是说

21:07.891 --> 21:10.352
"punish the nose, not the man."
“惩罚的是鼻子，而不是人。”

21:10.435 --> 21:13.146
Now we're going to need
something foul,
something beyond foul.
现在我们需要
一些肮脏的东西，
超出犯规范围的东西。

21:13.230 --> 21:17.859
A stench that will
blow the socks off
his fungus-infested socks.
一股恶臭将
吹掉袜子
他的长满真菌的袜子

21:23.031 --> 21:25.742
Ok, this should be
stinky enough.
好的，这应该是
够臭的。

21:25.826 --> 21:28.161
I gathered every
sweaty sock, moldy pizza
我收集了每一个
出汗的袜子，发霉的披萨

21:28.245 --> 21:30.580
and rotten piece of fruit
in Bikini Bottom.
和一块腐烂的水果
在比基尼底部。

21:30.664 --> 21:32.165
With a little raw sewage
for good measure.
用少量原污水
为了更好的衡量。

21:32.249 --> 21:33.709
Attaboy.
阿塔博伊。

21:33.792 --> 21:35.293
Now for the moment of truth.
现在到了关键时刻。

21:35.377 --> 21:36.753
Yes, sir.
是的，先生。

21:40.132 --> 21:41.466
Hello.
你好。

21:42.676 --> 21:44.052
Oh!
哦！

22:04.072 --> 22:08.618
All I wanted was to be able to
smell like the rest of you.
我想要的只是能够
闻起来像你们其他人。

22:23.216 --> 22:26.720
SpongeBob: "Here lies
the nose of Patrick Star, rip."
海绵宝宝：“这里躺着
帕特里克·斯塔的鼻子，撕裂。”

22:26.803 --> 22:28.889
Well, this is terrible.
嗯，这太可怕了。

22:28.972 --> 22:31.516
All Patrick wanted was
to be like the rest of us.
帕特里克想要的只是
像我们其他人一样。

22:31.600 --> 22:33.185
And we punished him for it.
我们因此惩罚了他。

22:33.268 --> 22:35.020
Who cares?
谁在乎？

22:35.103 --> 22:38.231
At least now that pink moron
will leave us alone.
至少现在那个粉红白痴
会让我们独自一人。

22:38.315 --> 22:39.941
Patrick: I heard that.
帕特里克：我听说了。

帕特里克：我听说了。